ass=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">Kiểm tra Lớp học</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"ml-10\">\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">\n                            Vào: <strong>Lớp học</strong>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">Tìm lớp theo các điều kiện:</p>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700 mb-4\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-primary-500 flex-shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                                    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"/>\n                                </svg>\n                                Khóa học\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-primary-500 flex-shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                                    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"/>\n                                </svg>\n                                Mã chuyên ngành\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-primary-500 flex-shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n                                    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"/>\n                                </svg>\n                